WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:04.020
Speaker 1: But you know who's not getting
rewarded right now?

00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:09.880
Republican Senator Lindsey Graham last week
in the state of South Carolina, the Aiken

00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:13.670
County Republican Party.

00:00:13.670 --> 00:00:20.110
Voted to censure Republican Senator Lindsey
Graham now so far this year, when we have

00:00:20.110 --> 00:00:24.680
seen Republicans come out and censure their
own members, usually it's because they've

00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:30.700
either said they don't agree with Donald Trump's
big lie or they've, you know.

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:34.760
Pretty much it's only been if they aren't
blindly loyal to Trump, so did Lindsey Graham

00:00:34.760 --> 00:00:37.000
do something we don't know about?

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:40.239
No, it's actually much worse than that.

00:00:40.239 --> 00:00:45.679
What Lindsey Graham's crime is, according
to this Aiken County Republican Party, in

00:00:45.679 --> 00:00:47.530
their censure.

00:00:47.530 --> 00:00:51.909
He voted to allow the infrastructure bill
to move forward.

00:00:51.909 --> 00:00:54.370
And they censured him for it.

00:00:54.370 --> 00:00:58.649
Just because he voted to allow the thing to
move forward and then, of course, he praised

00:00:58.649 --> 00:01:06.070
the bipartisan infrastructure bill, the trillion
dollar bill praised it, that's a good thing.

00:01:06.070 --> 00:01:09.000
But in today's Republican Party.

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:13.040
It's not only that you have to be blindly
loyal to Trump, but now it's you can't even

00:01:13.040 --> 00:01:15.430
vote.

00:01:15.430 --> 00:01:20.760
On a bipartisan piece of legislation without
facing backlash from your party.

00:01:20.760 --> 00:01:24.390
Because if that's the case, we're doomed.

00:01:24.390 --> 00:01:27.830
And this country is doomed.

00:01:27.830 --> 00:01:32.530
Because that's what this is this is a bipartisan
infrastructure bill that should go much further

00:01:32.530 --> 00:01:33.530
than it does.

00:01:33.530 --> 00:01:36.400
But, you know, we got the three and a half
trillion bill coming up behind it.

00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:38.800
Hopefully reconciliation will get that going.

00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:44.430
But either way, this is a bill that is broadly
supported across America by Republicans and

00:01:44.430 --> 00:01:46.030
Democrats and independents.

00:01:46.030 --> 00:01:49.550
Everybody, a majority of them support this.

00:01:49.550 --> 00:01:55.920
And they want this piece of legislation because
they know that infrastructure means jobs.

00:01:55.920 --> 00:01:57.580
Infrastructure means work.

00:01:57.580 --> 00:02:04.320
Infrastructure means investments in local
economies.

00:02:04.320 --> 00:02:10.960
But apparently the folks over at the Aiken
County Republican Party didn't get that memo.

00:02:10.960 --> 00:02:15.159
And they voted to censure him.

00:02:15.159 --> 00:02:17.019
Is this a new era?

00:02:17.019 --> 00:02:23.299
Have we finally entered the era here in the
United States where neither party can vote

00:02:23.299 --> 00:02:28.160
with the other one on a piece of legislation
where everything has to be so damn kindergarden,

00:02:28.160 --> 00:02:32.310
black and white with these people, where if
it's not a Republican bill, you have to vote

00:02:32.310 --> 00:02:33.579
against it?

00:02:33.579 --> 00:02:36.819
Even if Republicans worked on it, like with
the infrastructure bill?

00:02:36.819 --> 00:02:37.849
Nope.

00:02:37.849 --> 00:02:42.230
Republicans all always have to vote together
and Democrats always all have to vote together.

00:02:42.230 --> 00:02:47.459
Tribalism is killing us here in the United
States, the two party system tribalism is

00:02:47.459 --> 00:02:50.900
killing us here in the United States.

00:02:50.900 --> 00:02:57.069
This infrastructure package is decades overdue,
folks.

00:02:57.069 --> 00:03:01.359
And because Lindsey Graham actually said,
yeah, this is a good thing, he gets punished

00:03:01.359 --> 00:03:05.480
for it by these Aiken County Republicans.

00:03:05.480 --> 00:03:10.120
That's just nuts, and there's no other way
to say that this is ridiculous.

00:03:10.120 --> 00:03:18.269
We cannot allow our country to get to the
point where there is no bipartisanship allowed,

00:03:18.269 --> 00:03:21.510
where there's no negotiations allowed.

00:03:21.510 --> 00:03:25.599
Because if we ever truly hit that point, which
apparently is where the Aiken County Republicans

00:03:25.599 --> 00:03:27.919
want us to go, then we're done.

00:03:27.919 --> 00:03:28.919
That's it.

00:03:28.919 --> 00:03:34.700
Pack it up, start something new, because America
is not going to continue to function.

00:03:34.700 --> 00:03:39.090
If we ever hit that point where these Aiken
County Republicans clearly want to take us.

00:03:39.090 --> 00:03:39.340
I

